+  // Some titles (545407D4 Amped 3: menus, HUD, map) issue tfetch1D with an
+  // explicitly encoded second coordinate (src swizzle .xyz) against a 2D fetch
+  // constant, and the hardware samples it in 2D. Discarding Y samples only the
